1
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:06,519
In 2014, the world had almost twice as much wind power as solar.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,868
 10 GW， 100 GW。
Every plate is ten gigawatts. Every brass plate, one hundred.

3
00:00:11,875 --> 00:00:15,043
Wind kept growing. Solar grew faster.

4
00:00:21,875 --> 00:00:24,861
In 2021, solar passed wind.

5
00:00:25,625 --> 00:00:30,574
 2025 ， 500  GW。
In 2025 alone, solar added more than five hundred gigawatts.

6
00:00:30,625 --> 00:00:33,825
Step back, and twelve years become one dial.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,360
Now it is the other way round.
